1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:06,880
The animals had their breakfast, and then Snowball and Napoleon called them together again.

2
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:12,440
>> Comrades, it is half past six, and we have a long day before us.

3
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:19,039
Today, we begin the hay harvest, but there is another matter that must be attended to first.

4
00:00:19,039 --> 00:00:22,759
>> The pigs now revealed that during the past 3 months, they had taught

5
00:00:22,759 --> 00:00:27,480
themselves to read and write from an old spelling book which had belonged to Mr.

6
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:31,920
Jones's children and which had been thrown on the rubbish heap.

7
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:36,240
Napoleon sent for pots of black and white paint and led the way down to the

8
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:40,119
five-barred gate that gave onto the main road.

9
00:00:40,119 --> 00:00:44,720
Then Snowball, for it was Snowball who was best at writing,

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:51,039
took a brush between the two knuckles of his trotter, painted out Manor Farm from the top bar

11
00:00:51,039 --> 00:00:57,200
of the gate, and in its place painted Animal Farm.

12
00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:02,160
This was to be the name of the farm from now onwards.

13
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:06,720
After this, they went back to the farm buildings, where Snowball and Napoleon

14
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:12,880
sent for a ladder, which they caused to be set against the end wall of the big barn.

15
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:16,960
They explained that by their studies of the past 3 months, the pigs had

16
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:22,880
succeeded in reducing the principles of animalism to seven commandments.

17
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:27,039
These seven commandments would now be inscribed on the wall.

18
00:01:27,039 --> 00:01:32,119
They would form an unalterable law by which all the animals on Animal Farm

19
00:01:32,119 --> 00:01:35,880
must live forever after.

20
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:41,559
With some difficulty, for it is not easy for a pig to balance himself on a ladder,

21
00:01:41,559 --> 00:01:48,759
Snowball climbed up and set to work, with Squealer a few rungs below him holding the paint pot.

22
00:01:48,759 --> 00:01:52,640
The commandments were written on the tarred wall in great [clears throat]

23
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:57,319
white letters that could be read 30 yd away.

24
00:01:57,319 --> 00:01:59,000
They ran thus:
